{
  "tema": 5224,
  "slug": "traje-trajiste-trajeron",
  "titulo": "Traer in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "¿Quién trajo las tortillas?",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Traer is irregular in the preterite: stem traj- + -e, -iste, -o, -imos, -eron: traje, trajiste, trajo, trajimos, trajeron (no i after the j). Atraer, distraer, contraer and extraer follow it.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Traer** (_to bring_) changes its stem to **traj-** in the preterite."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The endings are **-e, -iste, -o, -imos**, and **-eron** in ellos: after a **j**, the **i** of -ieron disappears."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No written accents**: **traje**, **trajo**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "traer",
            "distraer"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "traje",
              "distraje"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "trajiste",
              "distrajiste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "trajo",
              "distrajo"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "trajimos",
              "distrajimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "trajeron",
              "distrajeron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "All its family works the same: **atraer** → **atrajo**, **contraer** → **contrajo**, **extraer** → **extrajeron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **traje** is also _a suit_. «Traje el traje» = _I brought the suit_."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¿Quién ==trajo== las tortillas?",
              "en": "Who brought the tortillas?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Traje== mi tabla nueva para enseñártela.",
              "en": "I brought my new board to show it to you."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Trajiste== tu kimono? Hoy hay entrenamiento.",
              "en": "Did you bring your gi? There's practice today."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis tíos nos ==trajeron== mangos de Sinaloa.",
              "en": "My aunt and uncle brought us mangoes from Sinaloa."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Trajimos== composta para el huerto.",
              "en": "We brought compost for the garden."
            },
            {
              "es": "El ruido me ==distrajo== y perdí la ola.",
              "en": "The noise distracted me and I missed the wave."
            },
            {
              "es": "La playa ==atrajo== a miles de turistas el fin de semana.",
              "en": "The beach drew thousands of tourists over the weekend."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
